    "title": "The Roku Channel",
    "description": "Welcome to The Roku Channel: Your home for free and live TV! \r\n400+ Live TV channels, Hollywood hits, trending TV series, exclusive Roku Originals, sports coverage, music, and popular kids\u2019 entertainment. All streaming free. \r\n\r\n\u2022 400+ Live TV channels: Local news and weather, TV favorites, and more \r\n\u2022 Roku Originals: Exclusive movies and shows \r\n\u2022 Espacio Latino: Spanish language entertainment including 65+ live channels \r\n\u2022 Family-friendly fun: Movies and shows both kids and parents will love \r\n\r\nLive TV  \r\nEnjoy 400+ live channels with local news and weather, sports coverage, cooking, and more. \r\n\r\nRoku Originals \r\nThe Roku Channel is the exclusive home for these Emmy\u00ae-nominated unique series and movies, like WEIRD: The Al Yankovic Story. \r\n\r\nEspacio Latino \r\nHit movies, popular shows, telenovelas, news, and family entertainment in Spanish\u2014all for free. Plus, stream 65+ free live channels with music and popular Latino entertainment. \r\n\r\nKids & Family \r\nGet the whole family together with free movies and shows everyone will enjoy. Easily set parental controls to ensure a carefree viewing experience.\r\n\r\nPopular music playlists \r\nFrom the latest chart-toppers, rock, rap, and cherished classics, our extensive music video library offers a mix for every mood and occasion.\r\n\r\nEasy streaming \r\nIt\u2019s quick and easy to find something great to watch with a simple layout designed for anyone to use.\r\n\r\nHappy Streaming\u2122",
